{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40734","headline":"乙酉岁自蜀随计趂试不及 · 李洞","name":"乙酉岁自蜀随计趂试不及","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"客卧涪江蘸月厅，知音唤起进趋生。\n寒梅折後方离蜀，腊月圆前未到京。\n风卷坏亭羸仆病，雪糊危栈蹇驴行。\n文昌一试应关分，岂校褒斜两日程。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李洞","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_40734.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40734","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}